#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Native layout model replacing the Matplotlib-backed GridFigure."
msgstr "替代基于 Matplotlib 的 GridFigure 的原生布局模型。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid ""
"It owns only geometry (figure size, spacing and allocated cells); Python "
"figure object identity is not claimed. close is idempotent and any later "
"allocation fails, matching the source lifecycle."
msgstr "它只拥有几何信息（图尺寸、间距和已分配单元格）；不声明 Python 图对象标识。close 是幂等的，之后的任何分配都会失败，与源实现的生命周期一致。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Creates a grid with rows rows and cols columns."
msgstr "创建具有 rows 行、cols 列的网格。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the configured row count."
msgstr "返回配置的行数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the configured column count."
msgstr "返回配置的列数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the current cursor row."
msgstr "返回当前游标行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the current cursor column."
msgstr "返回当前游标列。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns whether close() has been called."
msgstr "返回是否已调用 close()。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the fixed figure width of 14."
msgstr "返回固定的图宽度 14。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the figure height, seven units per row."
msgstr "返回图高度，每行七个单位。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the fixed horizontal spacing of 0.4."
msgstr "返回固定的水平间距 0.4。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the fixed vertical spacing of 0.3."
msgstr "返回固定的垂直间距 0.3。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the allocated cells in allocation order; empty after close()."
msgstr "按分配顺序返回已分配的单元格；close() 之后为空。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Returns the owned figure identifier (1 for every native grid)."
msgstr "返回自有的图标识符（每个原生网格均为 1）。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Allocates the next full-width row."
msgstr "分配下一个整行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Allocates the next cell, advancing to a new row when necessary."
msgstr "分配下一个单元格，必要时推进到新的一行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "Closes this grid's figure and releases layout state."
msgstr "关闭此网格的图并释放布局状态。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:25
msgid "The call is idempotent."
msgstr "该调用是幂等的。"

