msgstr "用作相关性输入的命名因子面板。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:292
msgid "One forward-return label row."
msgstr "一行前瞻收益标签记录。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:292
msgid "Forward-return period label, such as 1D."
msgstr "前瞻收益周期标签，例如 1D。"

