msgstr "该周期的前瞻收益；缺失时为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:295
msgid "Aggregated multi-factor evaluation result."
msgstr "聚合后的多因子评估结果。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:295
msgid ""
"status is OK when every named result is OK, UNEVALUABLE when all are, and "
"PARTIAL otherwise."
msgstr "当每个命名结果都为 OK 时 status 为 OK，全部为 UNEVALUABLE 时为 UNEVALUABLE，其余情况为 PARTIAL。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:295
msgid "Aggregated evaluation status."
msgstr "聚合后的评估状态。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:295
