msgstr "拼接后的信号，并标注因子名称。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:295
msgid "Counts and API/schema version metadata."
msgstr "计数以及 API/模式版本元数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Aggregated single-factor research result."
msgstr "聚合后的单因子研究结果。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid ""
"status is OK when every requested horizon has prepared rows, PARTIAL when at"
" least one horizon has none, and UNEVALUABLE when no horizon was prepared at"
" all."
msgstr "当所有请求的预测期都有准备好的行时 status 为 OK；至少一个预测期没有行时为 PARTIAL；没有任何预测期被准备时为 UNEVALUABLE。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Returns one named result table."
msgstr "返回一个命名的结果表。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid ""
"Unknown names raise a structured DatasetError (unknown_result_table). The "
"correlation and comparisons tables expose canonical columns with no rows in "
"this single-factor result."
msgstr "未知名称会抛出结构化的 DatasetError（unknown_result_table）。在该单因子结果中，相关性与比较表暴露规范的列但没有行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Returns the JSON-compatible status/manifest/tables/columns payload."
msgstr "返回与 JSON 兼容的 status/manifest/tables/columns 载荷。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "OK, PARTIAL or UNEVALUABLE."
msgstr "OK、PARTIAL 或 UNEVALUABLE。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Forward-return rows for prepared cells."
msgstr "已准备单元的前瞻收益行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Signal rows for evaluated cells."
msgstr "已评估单元的信号行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Per-date Spearman rank IC by period; NaN missing."
msgstr "按周期组织的逐日 Spearman 秩 IC；缺失为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Mean rank IC per period."
msgstr "每个周期的平均秩 IC。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Raw quantile return means and standard errors."
msgstr "原始分位收益均值与标准误。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Turnover series per quantile, first horizon."
msgstr "每个分位的换手率序列，取第一个预测期。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Rank autocorrelation per lag, first horizon."
msgstr "每个滞后阶的秩自相关，取第一个预测期。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Lags used for the stability series."
msgstr "稳定性序列所使用的滞后阶。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Top-minus-bottom quantile return per period; NaN if absent."
msgstr "每个周期的最高减最低分位收益；缺失时为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Prepared observation count per period."
msgstr "每个周期已准备的观测数量。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Human-readable status notes."
msgstr "人类可读的状态说明。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:298
msgid "Provenance key/value metadata."
msgstr "来源的键值元数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:301
msgid "One signal row: a factor observation for a date and asset."
msgstr "一行信号：某个日期与资产的因子观测。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:301
msgid "Factor name; factor for single-factor evaluations."
msgstr "因子名称；单因子评估时为 factor。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:301
msgid "Direction sign applied to the factor value."
msgstr "应用于因子取值的方向符号。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:301
msgid "Direction-adjusted raw factor value."
msgstr "经方向调整后的原始因子取值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:301
msgid "Value after direction adjustment and preprocessing."
msgstr "方向调整与预处理之后的取值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:301
msgid "Preprocessing method used for the panel."
msgstr "该面板使用的预处理方法。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:301
msgid "Configured group name, or default when groups are unset."
msgstr "配置的分组名称；未设置 groups 时为 default。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Execution specification consumed by the research evaluators."
msgstr "研究评估器消费的强制执行设定。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Requested targets; empty selects all observed assets."
msgstr "请求的目标；为空时选择所有观测到的资产。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Inclusive UTC-nanosecond window start."
msgstr "闭区间的 UTC 纳秒窗口起点。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Inclusive UTC-nanosecond window end."
msgstr "闭区间的 UTC 纳秒窗口终点。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Forward price-row horizons; non-empty, positive."
msgstr "前瞻价格行预测期；非空且为正。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Quantile bucket count; must be at least two."
msgstr "分位桶数量；必须至少为二。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Minimum asset count for correlation and detailed thresholds."
msgstr "相关性与详细阈值所用最少资产数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Minimum observations per quantile for detailed thresholds."
msgstr "详细阈值所用每分位最少观测数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Tolerated binning data-loss fraction in [0, 1]."
msgstr "可容忍的分桶数据损失比例，位于 [0, 1]。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Panel-evaluator factor pairs."
msgstr "面板评估器的因子对。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:304
msgid "Asset-to-group map covering evaluated assets."
msgstr "覆盖被评估资产的资产到分组映射。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:307
msgid "One named research result table in native column form."
msgstr "以原生列形式表示的一个命名研究结果表。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:307
msgid "Table name."
msgstr "表名。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:307
msgid "Column names in row-cell order."
msgstr "按行单元顺序排列的列名。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:307
msgid "Row-major cells aligned with columns."
msgstr "与列对齐的行优先单元。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid "Spread chart data for one forward period."
msgstr "单一前瞻周期的多空差图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid "Renders spreads, the rolling mean and the optional band as native SVG."
msgstr "将多空差、滚动均值与可选带宽渲染为原生 SVG。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid ""
"A zero line is added when dates are present; the band polygon is skipped "
"when band_lower is empty."
msgstr "存在日期时添加零线；band_lower 为空时跳过量带多边形。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid "Observation timestamps."
msgstr "观测时间戳。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid "Spreads in basis points; non-finite inputs become NaN."
msgstr "以基点表示的多空差；非有限输入变为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid ""
"Trailing 22-observation mean in basis points; NaN until 22 consecutive "
"finite spreads are available."
msgstr "以基点表示的 22 观测尾部均值；在出现 22 个连续有限多空差之前为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid ""
"Lower band in basis points; empty when no standard errors are supplied and "
"NaN where an input is non-finite."
msgstr "以基点表示的下带宽；未提供标准误时为空，输入非有限处为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid "Upper band in basis points, aligned with band_lower."
msgstr "以基点表示的上带宽，与 band_lower 对齐。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid ""
"Symmetric y-axis limit: the 95th percentile of finite absolute spreads, "
"falling back to 1.0 when no positive value exists."
msgstr "对称的 y 轴范围：有限绝对多空差的第 95 百分位，没有正值时回退为 1.0。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:310
msgid "Standard-error multiplier used to build the band."
msgstr "构建带宽所使用的标准误倍数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:313
msgid "Renderer style contexts (seaborn plotting_context / axes_style)."
msgstr "渲染器样式上下文（seaborn 的 plotting_context / axes_style）。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:313
msgid "Context or style name, such as \"notebook\"."
msgstr "上下文或样式名称，例如 \"notebook\"。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:313
msgid "Font scaling factor carried by the context."
msgstr "上下文携带的字体缩放因子。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:313
msgid "rc parameter overrides by name."
msgstr "按名称给出的 rc 参数覆盖。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:316
msgid "Deterministic trading-day set used by the factor calendar helpers."
msgstr "因子日历辅助函数使用的确定性交易日集合。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:316
msgid ""
"A calendar is defined by local wall dates: seven weekday flags plus a set of"
" holiday day numbers (days since 1970-01-01 in UTC). It intentionally has no"
" timezone object; timestamps are UTC nanoseconds."
msgstr "日历由本地日历日期定义：七个工作日标志加上一组节假日日序号（自 1970-01-01 起的 UTC 天数）。它有意不含时区对象；时间戳为 UTC 纳秒。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:316
msgid "Checks whether a day number is a trading day."
msgstr "检查某个日序号是否为交易日。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:316
msgid "Checks whether a timestamp falls on a trading day."
msgstr "检查某个时间戳是否落在交易日。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:316
msgid ""
"Counts trading sessions in [start_day, end_day) when start_day <= end_day; "
"otherwise returns the negation of the count in (end_day, start_day] (NumPy "
"busday_count half-open semantics)."
msgstr ""
"当 start_day <= end_day 时统计 [start_day, end_day) 内的交易场次；否则返回 (end_day, "
"start_day] 计数的相反数（NumPy busday_count 的半开区间语义）。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:316
msgid "Monday-first weekday mask. true marks a trading weekday."
msgstr "以周一为首位的工作日掩码。true 表示该工作日为交易日。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:316
msgid "Sorted, unique holiday day numbers. Never contains a non-weekday."
msgstr "已排序且唯一的节假日日序号。绝不包含非工作日。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:319
msgid "Quantile-return violin chart data for one forward period."
msgstr "单一前瞻周期的分位收益小提琴图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:319
msgid "Renders one violin polygon per group as native SVG."
msgstr "为每个组渲染一个小提琴多边形，输出为原生 SVG。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:319
msgid "Groups without density points or with zero density are skipped."
msgstr "没有密度点或密度为零的组被跳过。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:319
msgid "Groups, ascending by quantile."
msgstr "各组，按分位升序排列。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:322
msgid "Violin samples and quartiles for one quantile of a forward period."
msgstr "某一前瞻周期某个分位的小提琴样本与四分位数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:322
msgid "Finite period returns in basis points."
msgstr "以基点表示的有限周期收益。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:322
msgid "First quartile of samples in bps."
msgstr "样本的第一四分位（基点）。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:322
msgid "Median of samples in bps."
msgstr "样本的中位数（基点）。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:322
msgid "Third quartile of samples in bps."
msgstr "样本的第三四分位（基点）。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:322
msgid "Support points for the kernel-density estimate."
msgstr "核密度估计的支撑点。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:322
msgid "Density values aligned with density_x; empty when no density was computed."
msgstr "与 density_x 对齐的密度值；未计算密度时为空。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:325
msgid "Covariance estimator for the Fama-MacBeth standard errors."
msgstr "Fama-MacBeth 标准误的协方差估计器。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:325
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:325
msgid "I.i.d. sample standard errors."
msgstr "i.i.d. 样本标准误。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:325
msgid "Bartlett-kernel HAC standard errors at newey_west_lags."
msgstr "在 newey_west_lags 阶下的 Bartlett 核 HAC 标准误。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:328
msgid "Adds delta nanoseconds, counting whole days through calendar."
msgstr "加上 delta 纳秒，其中整日部分按 calendar 计数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:328
msgid ""
"The timedelta is normalized to a floor whole-day component plus a non-"
"negative remainder; the day component is rolled by the calendar and the "
"remainder is added afterwards. This matches pandas' Timestamp + "
"CalendarOffset(days) + remainder behaviour."
msgstr ""
"时长被归一化为向下取整的整日分量加上非负余数；整日分量按日历滚动，之后再加上余数。这与 pandas 的 Timestamp + "
"CalendarOffset(days) + remainder 行为一致。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:331
msgid "Adds delta nanoseconds to each timestamp using calendar."
msgstr "使用 calendar 为每个时间戳加上 delta 纳秒。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:331
msgid ""
"Applies the same normalization and whole-day roll rules as the scalar "
"overload and preserves the input order."
msgstr "应用与标量重载相同的归一化与整日滚动规则，并保持输入顺序。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:334
msgid ""
"Returns a calendar with every day marked as a trading day, matching pandas' "
"default Day offset."
msgstr "返回把每一天都标记为交易日的日历，与 pandas 默认的 Day 偏移一致。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:337
msgid "Computes the complete factor analysis model for one prepared panel."
msgstr "针对一个已准备的面板计算完整的因子分析模型。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:337
msgid ""
"Runs the information-coefficient, weight, return, quantile, spread, "
"turnover, rank-autocorrelation, cumulative, position and monthly aggregation"
" kernels over the selected labels. The returned model owns copies of the "
"input and of the requested options."
msgstr "在所选标签上运行信息系数、权重、收益、分位、多空差、换手、秩自相关、累积、持仓与月度汇总内核。返回的模型持有输入与所请求选项的副本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:340
msgid "Computes the analysis model together with an event-return study."
msgstr "同时计算分析模型与事件收益研究。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:340
msgid ""
"Event dates are the factor dates present in event_returns. Each window spans"
" event_before ledger rows before the event through event_after rows after "
"it, clipped to the ledger bounds; ledger values are used as given and are "
"demeaned across the universe when config.long_short is true."
msgstr ""
"事件日期为 event_returns 中存在的因子日期。每个窗口从事件之前的 event_before 条账行延伸到事件之后的 event_after"
" 行，并按账簿边界裁剪；账簿值按原样使用，当 config.long_short 为 true 时在整个股票池内做去均值处理。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:343
msgid "Applies spread, market-impact and borrow costs to gross returns."
msgstr "对毛收益应用点差、市场冲击与借券成本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:343
msgid ""
"Turnover is half the summed absolute weight change on each date. Spread cost"
" charges half_spread_bps on traded weight, impact cost charges "
"impact_coefficient * participation^impact_exponent per asset, and borrow "
"cost accrues on short positions from the supplied borrow panels."
msgstr ""
"换手率为每个日期权重绝对变化之和的一半。点差成本按成交权重收取 half_spread_bps，冲击成本按每个资产收取 "
"impact_coefficient * participation^impact_exponent，借券成本依据提供的借券面板在空头持仓上累积。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:346
msgid "Averages cumulative event-window returns per quantile."
msgstr "按分位对累积事件窗口收益求平均。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:346
msgid ""
"Builds one event panel per observed quantile and calls common_start_returns "
"with cumulative and date-mean output; each offset reports the mean and the "
"sample standard deviation of its cells, an offset with no cell has NaN mean "
"and deviation, and an offset with a single cell has a NaN deviation."
msgstr ""
"为每个观测到的分位构造一个事件面板，并以累积与日期均值输出调用 "
"common_start_returns；每个偏移报告其单元的均值与样本标准差，没有单元的偏移均值与标准差为 NaN，仅含一个单元的偏移标准差为 "
"NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:349
msgid "Creates a renderer axes style with a fixed font scale of 1.5."
msgstr "创建字体缩放固定为 1.5 的渲染器坐标轴样式。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:352
msgid "Move a backward-looking return series N date-level positions earlier."
msgstr "将回溯型收益率序列沿日期层级前移 N 个位置。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:352
msgid ""
"date_levels is the complete, sorted, unique date level from the source "
"MultiIndex, including unused dates. Rows with level positions below N are "
"discarded. Remaining rows retain their order, assets and values (including "
"NaNs) while their dates move to the level N positions earlier. A result is "
"empty when date_levels.size() <= N."
msgstr ""
"date_levels 为来自源 MultiIndex 的完整、已排序、唯一的日期层级，包含未被使用的日期。层级位置小于 N "
"的行被丢弃。其余行保持其顺序、资产与取值（包括 NaN），但日期移动到层级中前 N 个位置。当 date_levels.size() <= N "
"时结果为空。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:355
msgid "Applies the Benjamini-Hochberg step-up correction."
msgstr "应用 Benjamini-Hochberg 逐步提升校正。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:355
msgid ""
"Adjusted values are the monotone running minimum of n * p / rank, clamped to"
" [0, 1]. A hypothesis is rejected when its sorted p value is at or below "
"alpha * rank / n, which rejects the leading block up to the largest passing "
"rank. Empty input yields empty output."
msgstr ""
"调整后的取值为 n * p / rank 的单调滑动最小值，并截断到 [0, 1]。当某假设排序后的 p 值不高于 alpha * rank / n "
"时该假设被拒绝，从而拒绝直到最大通过秩的前缀块。空输入产生空输出。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:358
msgid "Builds cumulative-growth chart data for each quantile of one period."
msgstr "为单一周期的每个分位构造累积增长图表数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:358
msgid ""
"Means are averaged per date for the requested quantile and label, then "
"compounded from 1.0 in date order. Dates without a finite mean keep the "
"previous growth value. Quantiles are emitted in descending order, and the y "
"bounds cover every emitted growth value."
msgstr ""
"先按日期对所请求的分位与标签求均值，再按日期顺序从 1.0 起复利累积。没有有限均值的日期沿用前一个增长值。分位按降序输出，y "
"轴范围覆盖所有输出的增长值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:361
msgid "Builds event counts per equal-width time bucket."
msgstr "按等宽时间桶构造事件计数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:361
msgid ""
"values follows dates; non-finite values are skipped, and an empty values "
"counts every event. Buckets are half-open except the final bucket, which "
"also covers the latest date. A single distinct date produces one bucket."
msgstr ""
"values 与 dates 对应；非有限值被跳过，values "
"为空时统计所有事件。除最后一个桶外各桶均为左闭右开，最后一个桶还覆盖最新日期。只有一个不同日期时产生一个桶。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:364
msgid ""
"Resamples the compounded period curve and overlapping positions to a daily "
"grid, adds an explicit cash overlay, and derives the optional benchmark."
msgstr "将复利的周期曲线与重叠持仓重采样为日频网格，加入显式的现金叠加层，并派生出可选的基准。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:364
msgid ""
"Intraday holding remainders, capital-scaled dollar positions, and custom "
"trading calendars are not represented by this kernel."
msgstr "该内核不表示日内持仓剩余、按资本缩放的名义持仓以及自定义交易日历。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:367
msgid "Builds a renderer-independent factor analysis report from a computed model."
msgstr "由已计算的模型构造与渲染器无关的因子分析报告。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:367
msgid ""
"The document carries summary, information-coefficient, returns and turnover "
"sections in that order."
msgstr "文档按该顺序包含 summary、information-coefficient、returns 与 turnover 各节。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:370
msgid "Builds owning chart data for a factor tear sheet."
msgstr "为因子一览图构造带所有权的图表数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:370
msgid ""
"Time-series charts omit non-finite points, bar charts keep the panel "
"ordering of model, and the event histogram is rebuilt from the model's "
"finite return distribution."
msgstr "时序图省略非有限点，柱状图保持 model 的面板顺序，事件直方图由模型的有限收益分布重建。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:373
msgid "Builds normal Q-Q chart data from information coefficients."
msgstr "由信息系数构造正态 Q-Q 图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:373
msgid ""
"One chart is returned per label, each holding one series whose observations "
"are the IC values for that label; non-finite values are treated as zero. "
"Theoretical quantiles use the standard-normal inverse CDF."
msgstr "每个标签返回一个图，每个图包含一个序列，其观测值为该标签的 IC 值；非有限值按零处理。理论分位数使用标准正态分布的逆累积分布函数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:376
msgid "Builds spread time-series chart data for one forward period."
msgstr "为单一前瞻周期构造多空差时序图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:376
msgid ""
"Spreads and standard errors are converted from decimal returns to basis "
"points. The rolling mean is a trailing 22-observation mean and stays NaN "
"until 22 consecutive finite spreads exist. Bands are built as spread +/- "
"standard_error * 10000 * bandwidth when standard errors are supplied."
msgstr ""
"多空差与标准误由小数收益转换为基点。滚动均值为 22 个观测的尾部窗口均值，在出现 22 个连续有限多空差之前保持 NaN；提供标准误时，带宽按 "
"spread +/- standard_error * 10000 * bandwidth 构造。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:379
msgid ""
"Builds one heatmap per forward period (and per group when the table is "
"grouped)."
msgstr "为每个前瞻周期构造一个热力图（表已分组时还按分组构造）。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:379
msgid ""
"Years are the distinct calendar years observed for the selected group and "
"are emitted in ascending order. Months without a finite mean stay NaN with "
"present == false. No charts are returned when monthly.labels or "
"monthly.dates is empty."
msgstr ""
"年份为所选分组中观测到的不同日历年，并按升序输出。没有有限均值的月份保持 NaN 且 present == false。当 monthly.labels"
" 或 monthly.dates 为空时不返回任何图。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:382
msgid "Builds quantile-return violin data for one forward period."
msgstr "为单一前瞻周期构造分位收益的小提琴图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:382
msgid ""
"Each group collects finite mean returns for one quantile, converted from "
"decimal returns to basis points. Quartiles use linear interpolation over the"
" sorted samples, and the density is a Gaussian kernel estimate on 64 support"
" points when there are at least two samples and their deviation is positive."
" Quantiles are emitted in ascending order, and quantiles without finite "
"samples are omitted."
msgstr ""
"每组收集某一空头的有限平均收益，并由小数收益转换为基点。四分位数在排序样本上使用线性插值；当样本数至少为二且其偏差为正时，密度为 64 "
"个支撑点上的高斯核估计。分位按升序输出，没有有限样本的分位被省略。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:385
msgid "Returns a Monday-Friday calendar with no holidays."
msgstr "返回一个周一至周五、不含节假日的日历。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:388
msgid "Marks every owned figure as closed."
msgstr "将所有自有图形标记为已关闭。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:388
msgid "The identifier list is left unchanged, so the call is idempotent."
msgstr "标识符列表保持不变，因此该调用是幂等的。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:391
msgid "Extracts event-aligned return windows for a factor panel."
msgstr "为因子面板抽取与事件对齐的收益窗口。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:391
msgid ""
"Event dates are the factor dates present in the returns index. Each window "
"spans before ledger rows before the event through after rows after it, "
"clipped to the ledger bounds, so offsets near the edges are absent. Non-"
"finite ledger values are skipped. With cumulative the ledger is read as "
"already cumulative, otherwise each column is compounded into a wealth index "
"from one. demean_by subtracts the same-date cross-sectional mean of its "
"assets, and mean_by_date emits one averaged cell per offset and date."
msgstr ""
"事件日期为收益索引中存在的因子日期。每个窗口从事件之前的 before 账行延伸到事件之后的 after "
"行，并按账簿边界裁剪，因此靠近边缘的偏移缺失。非有限的账簿值被跳过。cumulative 为真时账簿按已是累积值读取，否则将每列从 1 "
"起复利为财富指数。demean_by 减去其资产在同一日期的截面均值，mean_by_date 为每个偏移与日期输出一个平均单元。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:394
msgid "Computes forward returns for every factor observation from a price panel."
msgstr "由价格面板为每个因子观测计算前瞻收益。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:394
msgid ""
"Labels are the requested periods rendered as \"<period>D\". A value is NaN "
"when the factor date is absent from prices, the horizon runs past the panel,"
" or the base price is zero. When filter_zscore is set, forward returns "
"further than that many standard deviations from the per-asset mean are "
"removed independently for each label."
msgstr ""
"标签为按 \"<period>D\" 形式渲染的请求周期。当因子日期不在价格中、预测期超出面板或基准价格为零时取值为 NaN。设置 "
"filter_zscore 时，相对各资产均值偏离超过该标准差倍数的前瞻收益会按标签独立剔除。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:397
msgid "Creates the native render customization used around chart calls."
msgstr "创建图表调用前后使用的原生渲染定制对象。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:397
msgid ""
"The returned value uses the default plotting_context() and axes_style() "
"values and keeps the built-in eight-color palette."
msgstr "返回值使用默认的 plotting_context() 与 axes_style() 取值，并保留内置的八色配色。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:400
msgid "Restores the supported model envelope from serialized JSON text."
msgstr "从序列化的 JSON 文本恢复受支持的模型信封。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:400
msgid ""
"The root must be an object carrying schema, fingerprint_version, "
"result_fingerprint, config, forward_periods and loss_report. The schema must"
" equal the supported version, and the fingerprint version must fit in 32 "
"bits. Additional keys are ignored."
msgstr ""
"根节点必须是包含 "
"schema、fingerprint_version、result_fingerprint、config、forward_periods 与 "
"loss_report 的对象。schema 必须等于受支持的版本，指纹版本必须能用 32 位表示。多余的键会被忽略。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:403
msgid "Parses serialized model text into a native value."
msgstr "将序列化的模型文本解析为原生值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:403
msgid ""
"The text is parsed without checking the envelope schema; use "
"deserialize_factor_model to validate and restore the supported subset."
msgstr "解析文本时不校验信封 schema；需要校验并恢复受支持子集时应使用 deserialize_factor_model。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:406
msgid "Returns end - start with whole-day components measured by calendar."
msgstr "返回 end - start，其中整日部分按日历计量。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:406
msgid ""
"The wall-clock remainder is preserved; only the whole-day part is replaced "
"by the busday count. Both endpoints use local wall dates, as in the pinned "
"source."
msgstr "保留钟表时间余数；仅将整日部分替换为工作日计数。两端都使用本地日历日期，与固定版本源实现一致。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:409
msgid "Estimates the largest portfolio value a weight panel can trade."
msgstr "估计权重面板可交易的最大组合价值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:409
msgid ""
"Each date is limited by the tightest asset-level max_participation * "
"dollar_volume / |trade|; the panel capacity is the smallest finite date "
"limit. The first date that attains the limit and the asset limiting it are "
"reported as the binding pair."
msgstr ""
"每个日期受最紧的资产级约束 max_participation * dollar_volume / |trade| "
"限制；面板容量为最小的有限日期上限。首个达到该上限的日期以及造成限制的资产作为绑定对报告。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:412
msgid ""
"Evaluates one factor and exports its detailed result without materializing "
"owning signal and label row vectors."
msgstr "评估单个因子并导出其详细结果，而不构造带所有权的信号与标签行向量。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:412
msgid ""
"Large tables are synchronously written from the evaluator's live columns; no"
" borrowed view escapes the call. If evaluation or export fails, files "
"created by the call are removed, and a newly created destination is removed "
"only when it is empty. Existing empty destinations are retained and non-"
"empty destinations are rejected. Evaluation and writing may interleave: the "
"first encountered failure is propagated, rather than imposing the error "
"order of two separate calls."
msgstr "大表由评估器的实时列同步写出；不存在逃逸出本次调用的借用视图。若评估或导出失败，本次调用创建的文件会被删除，而新建的目标目录仅在其为空时被删除。已存在的空目标会被保留，非空目标会被拒绝。评估与写入可能交错：传播最先遇到的失败，而不是套用两次独立调用的错误顺序。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:415
msgid "Evaluates one factor against forward returns derived from prices."
msgstr "针对由价格派生的前瞻收益评估单个因子。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:415
msgid ""
"spec.label must be close_to_close or next_open_to_open; the precomputed "
"basis is served by the forward-return-table overload. Period labels are "
"derived from the price grid. close_to_close labels span period price rows "
"from each factor date; next_open_to_open labels enter one row later and span"
" period rows from that entry."
msgstr ""
"spec.label 必须为 close_to_close 或 "
"next_open_to_open；预计算基准由前瞻收益表重载提供。周期标签由价格网格派生。close_to_close 标签从每个因子日期起跨越 "
"period 个价格行；next_open_to_open 标签晚一行入场，并从该入场点起跨越 period 行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:418
msgid "Evaluates one factor against price-derived returns under a wide mask."
msgstr "在宽掩码约束下针对价格派生收益评估单个因子。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:418
msgid ""
"The boolean mask keeps only cells whose (date, asset) entry is true, and the"
" returned result records universe=applied in its manifest."
msgstr "布尔掩码只保留 (date, asset) 项为 true 的单元，返回结果在其 manifest 中记录 universe=applied。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:421
msgid "Evaluates one factor against caller-supplied forward returns."
msgstr "针对调用方提供的前瞻收益评估单个因子。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:421
msgid ""
"spec.label must not be next_open_to_open; the result manifest records the "
"precomputed label."
msgstr "spec.label 不得为 next_open_to_open；结果 manifest 记录预计算标签。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:424
msgid "Evaluates one named factor against price-derived forward labels."
msgstr "针对价格派生的前瞻标签评估一个命名因子。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:424
msgid ""
"factor_name supplies the Python DataFrame column name used for direction "
"overrides and output rows. spec.start/end and all input timestamps are UTC "
"nanoseconds. Only close_to_close and next_open_to_open are supported by this"
" price-based overload; precomputed labels and multi-factor combinations are "
"rejected explicitly."
msgstr ""
"factor_name 提供用于方向覆盖与输出行的 Python DataFrame 列名。spec.start/end 及所有输入时间戳均为 UTC "
"纳秒。该基于价格的重载仅支持 close_to_close 与 next_open_to_open；预计算标签与多因子组合会被显式拒绝。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:427
msgid "Evaluates multiple named factor panels and derives correlations/comparisons."
msgstr "评估多个命名因子面板并派生相关性/比较结果。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:427
msgid ""
"Each panel is evaluated independently; spec.combinations are then blended "
"from the processed panels with preprocessing disabled and direction "
"overrides cleared, and the named comparisons are appended."
msgstr "每个面板独立评估；随后在禁用预处理并清除方向覆盖的条件下，由已处理的面板混合出 spec.combinations，并追加命名的比较项。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:430
msgid "Writes deterministic CSV tables and a JSON manifest without overwriting."
msgstr "写入确定性的 CSV 表与 JSON manifest，且不覆盖已有内容。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:430
msgid ""
"A preexisting destination is rejected and left untouched. A directory "
"created by this call is removed if a later write fails. charts=true requests"
" raster chart export, which the native library does not provide; it fails "
"closed instead of silently skipping charts."
msgstr ""
"已存在的目标目录会被拒绝并保持不动。若后续写入失败，本次调用创建的目录会被删除。charts=true "
"请求导出栅格图，而原生库不提供该能力；因此以失败关闭的方式处理，而不是静默跳过图表。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:433
msgid ""
"Exports the ten factor-local detailed research tables as UTF-8/LF CSV files "
"with a versioned JSON manifest."
msgstr "将十张因子级详细研究表导出为 UTF-8/LF 的 CSV 文件，并附带带版本的 JSON manifest。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:433
msgid ""
"Rows retain the order in result. The single-factor result must have empty "
"correlation and comparison tables; their omission is identified in the "
"manifest's engine metadata."
msgstr "行保持 result 中的顺序。单因子结果的相关性与比较表必须为空；其缺失在 manifest 的 engine 元数据中标识。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:433
msgid ""
"A non-empty destination is never overwritten. If an export fails, only files"
" created by this call are removed; a newly created destination is removed "
"only when it is empty. An existing empty destination is retained."
msgstr "非空目标目录绝不会被覆盖。若导出失败，只删除本次调用创建的文件；新建的目标目录仅在其为空时删除。已存在的空目标目录会被保留。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:436
msgid "Regresses portfolio returns on the same-date universe mean return."
msgstr "将组合收益对同日期的股票池平均收益做回归。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:436
msgid ""
"The slope is the OLS beta against the equal-weighted universe mean of each "
"label; the intercept is annualized with 252 / N periods, where N is the "
"leading whole-day count of the label. Fewer than two usable dates or a zero "
"market variance leaves the estimates NaN, and a label without a leading day "
"count leaves only annual_alpha NaN."
msgstr ""
"斜率为对每个标签的等权股票池均值做 OLS 得到的 beta；截距按 252 / N 个周期年化，其中 N "
"为该标签前导的整日数。可用日期少于两个或市场方差为零时估计值为 NaN；没有前导日数的标签仅使 annual_alpha 为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:439
msgid "Compounds the selected period returns from one."
msgstr "将所选周期的收益从 1 起复利累积。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:442
msgid "Computes the Spearman rank information coefficient per date and label."
msgstr "按日期与标签计算 Spearman 秩信息系数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:442
msgid ""
"Each cell correlates the finite factor values with the matching forward "
"returns across the assets of one date bucket; fewer than two usable pairs "
"leave the cell as NaN. group_adjust demeans forward returns within each "
"(date, group) bucket first and therefore requires groups, while by_group "
"emits one row per (date, group) pair instead of one row per date."
msgstr ""
"每个单元在一个日期桶的资产范围内将有限因子值与对应的前瞻收益做相关；可用配对少于两个时该单元为 NaN。group_adjust 先在每个 (date,"
" group) 桶内对前瞻收益去均值，因此必须提供 groups；by_group 为每个 (date, group) 对输出一行，而不是每个日期一行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:445
msgid "Runs IC inference and false-discovery-rate correction on the model."
msgstr "对模型执行 IC 推断与错误发现率校正。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:445
msgid ""
"Forwards model.information_coefficient to information_coefficient_inference;"
" per-group tables are not consulted."
msgstr "将 model.information_coefficient 传给 information_coefficient_inference；不读取分组表。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:448
msgid "Returns stable operation descriptors for the factor runtime catalog."
msgstr "返回因子运行时目录的稳定操作描述符。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:451
msgid "Computes SHA-256 over the canonical descriptor listing (identifier order)."
msgstr "在规范化的描述符列表（按标识符排序）上计算 SHA-256。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:454
msgid "Builds overlapping gross-normalized trade positions for one factor period."
msgstr "为单个因子周期构造重叠且按毛额归一化的交易持仓。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:454
msgid ""
"period_label counts whole business days (for example \"3D\" or \"1D2D\"); a "
"holding expires on the corresponding Monday-Friday weekday calendar without "
"exchange-holiday knowledge, matching pandas' default BusinessDay offset. The"
" result spans every trade and expiry timestamp, including a zero row after "
"the final holding expires."
msgstr ""
"period_label 以整工作日计数（例如 \"3D\" 或 \"1D2D\"）；持仓在对应的周一至周五工作日历上到期，不考虑交易所节假日，与 "
"pandas 默认的 BusinessDay 偏移一致。结果覆盖每一笔交易与到期时间戳，并在最后一个持仓到期之后包含一行为零的行。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:457
msgid "Computes the rank autocorrelation of the factor at a fixed lag."
msgstr "计算因子在固定滞后阶上的秩自相关。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:457
msgid ""
"Factor values are average-ranked within each date and then correlated with "
"the lagged ranks over the assets present on both dates. Non-finite factor "
"values are excluded; the first period dates, fewer than two shared assets "
"and a constant rank vector yield NaN."
msgstr ""
"因子值在每个日期内取平均秩，然后在两个日期都存在的资产上与滞后秩做相关。非有限的因子值被排除；前 period "
"个日期、共有资产少于两个以及秩向量为常数都得到 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:460
msgid "Computes portfolio returns from factor weights."
msgstr "由因子权重计算组合收益。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:460
msgid ""
"Calls factor_weights with the same options and accumulates weight times "
"forward return per date and label, skipping any pair with a non-finite "
"value."
msgstr "以相同选项调用 factor_weights，并按日期与标签累加权重乘以前瞻收益，跳过任一取值非有限的配对。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:463
msgid "Computes per-observation factor weights."
msgstr "计算逐观测的因子权重。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:463
msgid ""
"Weights form inside each (date[, group]) bucket: demeaned centers the bucket"
" values, equal_weight gives each side of zero an equal share, and the bucket"
" is divided by its gross absolute exposure. group_adjust then renormalizes "
"across the groups of each date. A bucket whose gross exposure is zero or "
"non-finite yields NaN weights."
msgstr ""
"权重在每个 (date[, group]) 桶内形成：demeaned 对桶内值做中心化，equal_weight "
"让零的两侧各占相等份额，然后桶除以其绝对毛暴露。group_adjust 随后在每个日期的各组之间重新归一化。毛暴露为零或非有限的桶产生 NaN 权重。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:466
msgid "Returns the built-in named factor workflows."
msgstr "返回内置的命名因子工作流。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:466
msgid ""
"The list covers the summary, returns, information, turnover, full, "
"event_returns and event_study workflows."
msgstr ""
"列表涵盖 summary、returns、information、turnover、full、event_returns 与 event_study "
"工作流。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:469
msgid "Runs Fama-MacBeth cross-sectional regressions."
msgstr "运行 Fama-MacBeth 截面回归。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:469
msgid ""
"Each return date with a matching exposure row, or the single exposure row "
"that is broadcast across dates, is regressed cross-sectionally across the "
"shared asset columns. A cross-section is skipped when fewer than two assets "
"are finite or the exposures do not vary. The coefficient series are then "
"summarized with i.i.d. or Bartlett Newey-West standard errors; a standard "
"error at or below 1e-15 yields an infinite t statistic, or zero when the "
"mean is zero."
msgstr ""
"对每个存在匹配暴露行的收益日期，或在各日期上广播的唯一个暴露行，在共有资产列上做截面回归。当有限资产少于两个或暴露没有变化时跳过该截面。随后用 "
"i.i.d. 或 Bartlett Newey-West 标准误汇总系数序列；标准差不高于 1e-15 时 t 统计量为无穷，均值为零时取零。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:472
msgid "Looks up a workflow by identifier and returns nullptr when absent."
msgstr "按标识符查找工作流，不存在时返回 nullptr。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:475
msgid "Returns a stable SHA-256 digest over the canonical native encoding."
msgstr "返回在规范原生编码上的稳定 SHA-256 摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:475
msgid ""
"The digest covers detail::canonical_factor_value(value), is 64 lowercase "
"hexadecimal characters, and is independent of object insertion order and NaN"
" payloads."
msgstr ""
"摘要基于 detail::canonical_factor_value(value) 计算，为 64 个小写十六进制字符，且不受对象插入顺序与 NaN "
"载荷影响。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:478
msgid "Returns the fingerprint of serializable_value(model)."
msgstr "返回 serializable_value(model) 的指纹。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:481
msgid "Returns the fingerprint of serializable_value(report)."
msgstr "返回 serializable_value(report) 的指纹。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:484
msgid "Returns the fingerprint of the serialized research result."
msgstr "返回序列化研究结果的指纹。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:487
msgid "Select labels matching the pinned factor forward-return grammar."
msgstr "选取符合固定版本因子前瞻收益语法的标签。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:487
msgid ""
"Results keep the input order and duplicates. Invalid labels are skipped. "
"With require_exact_day_multiple, only repeated day components are kept; "
"unlike the Python implementation, the native helper skips silently instead "
"of emitting a warning."
msgstr ""
"结果保持输入顺序与重复项。非法标签被跳过。require_exact_day_multiple 为真时只保留重复的日成分；与 Python "
"实现不同，原生辅助函数静默跳过而不发出警告。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:490
msgid "Computes a normal confidence interval for the mean IC."
msgstr "计算平均 IC 的正态置信区间。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:490
msgid ""
"The half-width is z times the sample standard error of the non-NaN values. "
"Fewer than two usable values yield NaN bounds."
msgstr "半宽为 z 乘以非 NaN 取值的样本标准误。可用取值少于两个时区间边界为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:493
msgid "Computes the mean of a sample of IC values."
msgstr "计算 IC 取值样本的均值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:493
msgid "NaN entries are skipped; an empty or all-NaN sample yields NaN."
msgstr "跳过 NaN 项；空样本或全 NaN 样本返回 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:496
msgid "Computes the t statistic of a sample of IC values."
msgstr "计算 IC 取值样本的 t 统计量。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:496
msgid ""
"The statistic is the mean divided by the sample standard error computed from"
" the one-degree-of-freedom deviation. NaN entries are skipped; fewer than "
"two usable values yield NaN, and a standard error below 1e-15 yields an "
"infinity or zero that follows the sign of the mean."
msgstr ""
"统计量为均值除以由一阶自由度偏差计算的样本标准误。跳过 NaN 项；可用取值少于两个时返回 NaN；标准差低于 1e-15 "
"时返回无穷或零，其符号跟随均值的符号。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:499
msgid ""
"Infers trading weekdays and missing-session holidays from factor and price "
"dates."
msgstr "由因子与价格日期推断交易日的工作日与缺失交易日对应的节假日。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:499
msgid "The union is normalized to days; an empty union is rejected."
msgstr "并集被归一化到日；空并集会被拒绝。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:502
msgid "Tests each IC label for a zero mean with an FDR adjustment."
msgstr "对每个 IC 标签检验均值为零，并做 FDR 校正。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:502
msgid ""
"Per label, the finite entries of the IC table are pooled and tested with a "
"two-sided Student-t test on n - 1 degrees of freedom. Labels with fewer than"
" two finite entries are reported as untestable, with NaN t and p values. "
"Only the testable labels enter the Benjamini-Hochberg correction, which sets"
" rejected and adjusted_p_value."
msgstr ""
"对每个标签，汇总 IC 表中的有限项，并在 n - 1 自由度上做双侧 Student-t 检验。有限项少于两个的标签报告为不可检验，其 t 与 p "
"值为 NaN。只有可检验的标签进入 Benjamini-Hochberg 校正，该校正设置 rejected 与 adjusted_p_value。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:505
msgid "Loss wording used by the pinned strict facade's stdout projection."
msgstr "固定版本严格门面的 stdout 输出所使用的损失措辞。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:505
msgid ""
"Returns (input_count - forward_returns_count) / input_count and 0 for an "
"empty input."
msgstr "返回 (input_count - forward_returns_count) / input_count，空输入返回 0。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:508
msgid "Materializes a factor panel from point-in-time observations."
msgstr "由时点观测物化出因子面板。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:508
msgid ""
"For each evaluation date, an asset contributes the revision with the largest"
" (effective_from, known_at, as_of) among revisions that are already known "
"and effective on that date. Assets flagged outside the universe are skipped,"
" and assets without an eligible revision are absent from that date."
msgstr ""
"对每个评估日期，资产取自在该日期已知且已生效、(effective_from, known_at, as_of) "
"最大的修订版本。被标记为股票池之外的资产被跳过，没有合格修订版本的资产在该日期缺失。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:511
msgid "Computes the mean information coefficient per label or per group."
msgstr "按标签或按分组计算平均信息系数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:511
msgid ""
"Averages the finite IC values across dates for aggregate output, or across "
"the rows of each group when by_group is true. A label or group with no "
"finite value yields NaN."
msgstr "汇总输出在各日期之间对有限 IC 取值求平均；by_group 为 true 时改为在每个分组的各行之间求平均。没有有限取值的标签或分组返回 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:514
msgid "Computes mean forward returns per quantile."
msgstr "按分位计算前瞻收益均值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:514
msgid ""
"Each date's quantile mean is the equal-weighted mean of its finite forward "
"returns; the reported mean averages those date means, and the standard error"
" is their sample deviation divided by the square root of the usable date "
"count. A quantile with no usable date keeps NaN."
msgstr ""
"每个日期的分位均值为该分位有限前瞻收益的等权均值；报告的均值是对这些日期均值再求平均，标准误是它们的样本标准差除以可用日期数的平方根。没有可用日期的分位保持"
" NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:517
msgid "Computes per-date quantile mean forward returns."
msgstr "计算逐日期的分位前瞻收益均值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:517
msgid ""
"Each (date, quantile, label) cell averages the finite forward returns of the"
" assets in that bucket; the standard error is their sample deviation divided"
" by the square root of their count and stays NaN below two values."
msgstr ""
"每个 (date, quantile, label) "
"单元对该桶内资产的前瞻收益有限值求平均；标准误为它们的样本标准差除以其数量的平方根，取值少于两个时保持 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:520
msgid "Computes the upper-minus-lower quantile return spread."
msgstr "计算 upper 分位减 lower 分位的收益差。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:520
msgid ""
"The spread subtracts the lower quantile mean from the upper quantile mean "
"and combines their standard errors in quadrature when both are finite."
msgstr "多空差为 upper 分位均值减去 lower 分位均值，并在两者标准误都有限时按平方和开根的方式合并标准误。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:523
msgid "Validates caller values and fills every documented default."
msgstr "校验调用方提供的取值并填充所有有文档记录的默认值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:526
msgid "Parses strict JSON into a native value."
msgstr "将严格的 JSON 解析为原生值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:526
msgid ""
"Integers are returned as 64-bit integer values where they fit, and other "
"numbers as doubles. Object keys must be strings."
msgstr "能容纳的整数返回为 64 位整数值，其他数值返回为 double。对象的键必须为字符串。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:529
msgid "Parses a forward-return duration label into nanoseconds."
msgstr "将前瞻收益的时长标签解析为纳秒。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:529
msgid ""
"Accepts an optional leading sign followed by one or more <digits><unit> "
"components, where unit is one of D, h, m, s, ms, us, ns (case-insensitive). "
"Malformed labels are rejected."
msgstr ""
"接受可选的前导符号，其后为一个或多个 <digits><unit> 成分，其中 unit 为 D、h、m、s、ms、us、ns "
"之一（不区分大小写）。格式非法的标签会被拒绝。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:532
msgid "Builds cumulative-growth chart data via build_cumulative_returns_by_quantile."
msgstr "通过 build_cumulative_returns_by_quantile 构造累积增长图表数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:532
msgid "Arguments and validation are forwarded unchanged."
msgstr "参数与校验原样转发。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:535
msgid "Builds event-bucket chart data via build_events_distribution."
msgstr "通过 build_events_distribution 构造事件分桶图表数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:538
msgid "Builds Q-Q chart data via build_ic_qq."
msgstr "通过 build_ic_qq 构造 Q-Q 图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:541
msgid "Builds spread chart data via build_mean_quantile_returns_spread_time_series."
msgstr "通过 build_mean_quantile_returns_spread_time_series 构造多空差图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:544
msgid "Builds monthly IC heatmap data via build_monthly_ic_heatmap."
msgstr "通过 build_monthly_ic_heatmap 构造月度 IC 热力图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:547
msgid "Builds quantile-return violin data via build_quantile_returns_violin."
msgstr "通过 build_quantile_returns_violin 构造分位收益小提琴图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:550
msgid "Creates a renderer style context with an explicit font scale."
msgstr "创建带显式字体缩放的渲染器样式上下文。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:550
msgid ""
"The returned context uses context as its name and keeps rc unchanged except "
"for adding lines.linewidth=1.5 when that key is absent."
msgstr "返回的上下文以 context 作为名称，除在该键缺失时添加 lines.linewidth=1.5 之外保持 rc 不变。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:553
msgid "Prepares a quantified factor panel from raw factor values and prices."
msgstr "由原始因子值与价格准备量化的因子面板。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:553
msgid ""
"Forward returns are computed with config.periods, observations without a "
"finite value for every label are dropped, and the remainder is quantified "
"within the configured cross-sections."
msgstr "前瞻收益按 config.periods 计算，任一标签都没有有限值的观测被丢弃，其余观测在配置的截面内进行量化。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:556
msgid "Prepares one quantified panel per forward-return horizon."
msgstr "为每个前瞻收益预测期准备一个量化面板。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:556
msgid ""
"Each horizon is bucketed against the cross-section with a finite return for "
"that horizon and checked against config.max_loss separately."
msgstr "每个预测期都针对该期收益为有限的截面分桶，并各自与 config.max_loss 校验。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:559
msgid "Prepares a quantified factor panel from a supplied forward-return table."
msgstr "由提供的前瞻收益表准备量化的因子面板。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:559
msgid ""
"The table must carry unique labels and unique (date, asset) rows, with one "
"value per row for every label. Observations whose pair is absent or whose "
"value is not finite are dropped and charged to the loss report."
msgstr "表必须具有唯一的标签以及唯一的 (date, asset) 行，并且每行对每个标签都有一个值。配对不存在或取值非有限的观测被丢弃，并计入损失报告。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:562
msgid "Prepares a quantified factor panel from point-in-time observations."
msgstr "由时点观测准备量化的因子面板。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:562
msgid ""
"The observations are first materialized into a factor panel and then "
"prepared against prices, so only information known and effective on each "
"evaluation date reaches the output."
msgstr "观测先被物化为因子面板，再针对价格准备，因此只有在每个评估日期已知且生效的信息才会进入输出。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:565
msgid "Computes quantile turnover at a fixed lag."
msgstr "计算固定滞后阶下的分位换手率。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:565
msgid ""
"Turnover on a date is the share of the quantile's assets that were absent "
"period dates earlier; membership follows the supplied rows even when a "
"factor value is non-finite. The first period dates and dates whose quantile "
"is empty are NaN."
msgstr ""
"某日的换手率为该分位资产中在前 period 个日期里缺席的比例；成员关系依据提供的行判定，即使因子值非有限也是如此。前 period "
"个日期以及该分期为空的日期为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:568
msgid "Assigns one-based bucket labels to factor observations."
msgstr "为因子观测分配从 1 开始的桶标签。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:568
msgid ""
"Buckets are built per date, or per (date, group) pair when config.by_group "
"is true. Non-finite factor values receive no label."
msgstr "桶按日期构造；当 config.by_group 为 true 时按 (date, group) 对构造。非有限的因子值不获得标签。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:571
msgid "Returns the pinned native research capability declaration."
msgstr "返回固定版本的原生研究能力声明。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:574
msgid "Computes mean-IC and ICIR differences for named factor pairs, per period."
msgstr "按周期计算命名因子对的平均 IC 与 ICIR 之差。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:574
msgid ""
"Period labels are the union of both stored IC label sets. Statistics use "
"finite IC values only; a difference is NaN when either side is unavailable."
msgstr "周期标签为两侧已存储 IC 标签集合的并集。统计量只使用有限的 IC 取值；任一侧不可用时差值为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:577
msgid ""
"Computes per-date Pearson correlations across common assets for every factor"
" pair."
msgstr "对每个因子对按日期在共有资产上计算 Pearson 相关系数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:577
msgid ""
"Dates with fewer than min_assets common finite assets and dates with zero "
"dispersion on either side are skipped. Pairs follow input order, and each "
"row summarizes the contributing dates."
msgstr "共有有限资产少于 min_assets 的日期以及任一侧离散度为零的日期被跳过。因子对遵循输入顺序，每行汇总有贡献的日期。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:580
msgid "Returns the native value form used by fingerprints and JSON envelopes."
msgstr "返回指纹与 JSON 信封使用的原生值形式。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:583
msgid "Converts a factor-analysis model into its native envelope value."
msgstr "将因子分析模型转换为其原生信封值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:583
msgid ""
"The envelope carries the schema identifier, fingerprint version, result "
"fingerprint, configuration, forward periods, loss report, quantile "
"statistics and tables, IC tables, mean-return spread, turnover and rank-"
"autocorrelation series, and optional event analysis. Non-finite entries in "
"the IC, quantile, turnover, rank-autocorrelation and event arrays are "
"encoded as null."
msgstr ""
"信封包含模式标识符、指纹版本、结果指纹、配置、前瞻周期、损失报告、分位统计与表、IC "
"表、平均收益多空差、换手率与秩自相关序列，以及可选的事件分析。IC、分位、换手率、秩自相关与事件数组中的非有限项编码为 null。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:586
msgid "Converts a loss report into a native object value."
msgstr "将损失报告转换为原生对象值。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:589
msgid "Returns the figure identifiers in display order without opening a window."
msgstr "按显示顺序返回图形标识符，且不打开窗口。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:592
msgid "Snapshots a native dataframe and computes its deterministic content digest."
msgstr "对原生 DataFrame 做快照并计算其确定性的内容摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:595
msgid "Snapshots a native dataframe by taking ownership of its storage."
msgstr "通过接管存储的方式对原生 DataFrame 做快照。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:598
msgid "Returns the two-sided Student-t tail probability."
msgstr "返回双侧 Student-t 尾部概率。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:598
msgid ""
"Uses the regularized incomplete beta function for df degrees of freedom. A "
"NaN statistic or a non-positive or NaN df yields NaN; an infinite statistic "
"yields zero."
msgstr "使用 df 自由度的正则化不完全贝塔函数。统计量为 NaN，或 df 为非正/NaN 时返回 NaN；统计量为无穷时返回零。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:601
msgid "Returns the whole-day component of each pandas-style duration string."
msgstr "返回每个 pandas 风格时长字符串的整日部分。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:604
msgid "Formats a duration using the pinned forward-return label grammar."
msgstr "使用固定版本的前瞻收益标签语法格式化时长。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:604
msgid ""
"Components follow pandas' normalized representation (floor days and a non-"
"negative remainder), for example -1h becomes \"-1D23h\" and a zero duration "
"becomes \"\"."
msgstr "成分遵循 pandas 的归一化表示（向下取整的天数加非负余数），例如 -1h 变为 \"-1D23h\"，零时长变为 \"\"。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:607
msgid "Serializes a native value as deterministic, standards-compliant JSON text."
msgstr "将原生值序列化为确定性、符合标准的 JSON 文本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:607
msgid ""
"Object keys are emitted in sorted order, so the text is stable for a given "
"value."
msgstr "对象按键的排序顺序输出，因此同一取值产生的文本是稳定的。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:610
msgid "Projects a normalized evaluation spec onto the execution spec."
msgstr "将已归一化的评估设定投影为执行设定。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:613
msgid "Returns the JSON text form of serializable_value(model)."
msgstr "返回 serializable_value(model) 的 JSON 文本形式。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:613
msgid "This is the native equivalent of the Python to_serializable method."
msgstr "这是 Python to_serializable 方法的原生等价实现。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:616
msgid "Validates point-in-time ordering and finiteness."
msgstr "校验时点顺序与有限性。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:616
msgid ""
"Each point must carry a finite value, with known_at not before as_of and "
"effective_from not before known_at."
msgstr "每个点必须携带有限取值，且 known_at 不早于 as_of、effective_from 不早于 known_at。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:619
msgid "Source-name alias for factor_data_error."
msgstr "factor_data_error 的源名称别名。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:622
msgid "Source-name aliases preserving the enhanced/strict split."
msgstr "保留 enhanced/strict 区分的源名称别名。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:625
msgid "Alphalens-compatible decimal-to-basis-points scale."
msgstr "与 Alphalens 兼容的小数转基点比例。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:628
msgid "Schema version of the normalized research evaluation configuration."
msgstr "归一化后的研究评估配置的模式版本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:631
msgid "Alias for DECIMAL_TO_BPS."
msgstr "DECIMAL_TO_BPS 的别名。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:634
msgid "Lower-case alias of EVALUATION_CONFIG_SCHEMA_VERSION."
msgstr "EVALUATION_CONFIG_SCHEMA_VERSION 的小写别名。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:637
msgid "Version of the native result-fingerprint encoding."
msgstr "原生结果指纹编码的版本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:637
msgid ""
"Mixed into every result fingerprint and echoed by "
"factor_analysis_model::result_fingerprint_version."
msgstr "混入每个结果指纹，并由 factor_analysis_model::result_fingerprint_version 回显。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:640
msgid "Operation identifier of the shared factor analysis kernel."
msgstr "共享因子分析内核的操作标识符。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:643
msgid "Nanoseconds in one calendar day."
msgstr "一个日历日包含的纳秒数。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:646
msgid "Research API version reported by capability and result manifests."
msgstr "能力声明与结果 manifest 报告的研究 API 版本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:649
msgid "Detailed research API version recorded in result and export manifests."
msgstr "记录在结果与导出 manifest 中的详细研究 API 版本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:652
msgid "Schema identifier written to the detailed export manifest."
msgstr "写入详细导出 manifest 的模式标识符。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:655
msgid "Schema version written to the detailed export manifest."
msgstr "写入详细导出 manifest 的模式版本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:658
msgid "Schema version of research_detailed_result."
msgstr "research_detailed_result 的模式版本。"

#: ../../site/api/factor.md:661
msgid "Schema version of research result envelopes and their manifests."
msgstr "研究结果信封及其 manifest 的模式版本。"

